The '''Communal Stew''' is an area where the [[Harvest Feast]] is held.

== Location ==
The '''Communal Stew''' is located in the {{Zone|Farm}}, which is north-east of the {{Zone|Village}}.

== Features ==
The '''Communal Stew''' features a large bakery and a giant metal pot, which gradually fills up over the course of the [[Harvest Feast]]. {{NPCSprite|Feast Chef Ted}} stands by the pot, where players can see which crops are in-season and their [[Harvest Feast#Feast Milestones|Feast Milestones]].

While {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}} is in office with the {{AN|Grand Feast}} perk, {{NPCSprite|Feast Baker Scott}} appears in the bakery. Players can purchase items from him using {{Kernels}}.

